# Scripts under skills/*/scripts/ that have no test file yet. One line per
# script, repo-root-relative. Blank lines and comment lines are not entries.
#
# This file is an exemption list, not a checklist: an entry naming a script that
# no longer exists is an error, and an entry for a script that has since gained a
# test is merely unnecessary. Zero entries — including "only these comments
# remain" — and an absent file both mean "no exemptions", which is the gate's
# success state. The gate is permanent; nothing here asks for its removal.
